<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Refund Processed</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: #c8a882; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .amount-box { background: #faf9f7; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; text-align: center; }
    .amount-box .label { font-size: 13px; color: #7a5c45; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .amount-box .amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #3d2b1f; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 EziHubb</h1>
      <p>Refund Processed</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Hi {{firstName}}, your refund is on its way</h2>
      <p>We've processed a refund for your order <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong>.</p>

      <div class="amount-box">
        <div class="label">Refund Amount</div>
        <div class="amount">${{refundAmount}} {{currency}}</div>
      </div>

      <p>Refunds typically take 5–10 business days to appear on your statement depending on your bank or card issuer.</p>
      <p>If you have any questions about this refund, please don't hesitate to contact us — we're here to help.</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The EziHubb Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EziHubb. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
